现，重点分析微生物代谢物（SCFAs、胆汁酸等）与宿主免疫系统（TLR信号、cGAS/STING通路等）的交互作用。此外，还结合了肿瘤异质性（病因、基因、代谢）背景，讨论微生物组在不同亚型HCC中的特异性表现。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0cb4e4ad111e1b49747ed92f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"系统总结了HCC患者中区分ICI响应者与无响应者的具体微生物分类学特征和功能通路，提供了潜在的预测生物标志物列表。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索数据库、时间范围及纳入排除标准，无法评估综述的全面性和偏倚风险。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b00dcdd9eb00a66a74612344\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"构建了“微生物-代谢物-免疫”在HCC免疫治疗中的机制框架，特别是强调了胆汁酸和SCFAs的作用。\",\n          \"limits\": \"机制部分主要基于转述的基础研究和少量临床关联数据，许多因果链条（如特定菌株直接导致特定代谢物变化进而改善预后）在人类HCC中尚未完全确证，存在动物模型外推的不确定性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5c3f99e6a4485b196a616344\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"识别了肿瘤异质性（病因、基因、代谢）对微生物组-免疫互作的影响，提示个性化微生物干预的必要性。\",\n          \"limits\": \"对于不同异质性亚型的具体干预策略缺乏直接的临床证据支持，多为理论推导或基于其他癌症类型的类比。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cfea509b7c87fc208f5c569c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"指出了当前研究的方法学局限（如测序方法、分析流程不一致）和未来方向（多组学、标准化）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，其结论依赖于已发表研究的质量，未能提供新的原始数据或独立验证队列。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::851db4dec05ec03b53c55a5d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI单药治疗（如Nivolumab, Camrelizumab）\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者通常表现出更高的微生物多样性（Shannon指数）和特定菌属富集，如Akkermansia muciniphila、Ruminococcaceae、Citrobacter freundii；无响应者则富集Proteobacteria、Escherichia coli、Dialister pneumosintes及Prevotella。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3928c283a8e4280e54c54f41\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI联合TKI治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"组合疗法显示出优于单药的临床结果，微生物特征显示Lachnospiraceae、Ruminococcus、Faecalibacterium等有益菌在响应者中富集，而Bacteroides、Veillonella等在部分研究中与无响应相关。不同研究间存在显著的菌群标识差异，可能与方法学变异有关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e041d2a6f54b96184e595f54\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"微生物干预措施\",\n          \"finding\": \"抗生素暴露通常与ICIs疗效降低和不良事件增加相关，但个别研究显示短期窗口期内的特定抗生素可能增强疗效。益生菌（如Probio-M9/Lactobacillus rhamnosus）在临床试验中提高了ORR。FMT在早期试验中显示出激活CD4+/CD8+ T细胞和抑制肿瘤生长的潜力，但安全性和标准化仍是主要障碍。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::277be6ab0272039613e4b0f7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"机制层面：代谢物与免疫调节\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物代谢物如SCFAs维持肠道屏障并抑制肿瘤增殖；次级胆汁酸（UDCA, TUDCA）通过激活NKT细胞分泌IFN-γ/TNF增强抗肿瘤免疫；MAMPs通过TLR通路招募免疫细胞但也可能导致炎症和致癌。特定菌株（如A. muciniphila）可通过STING通路激活DC细胞和NK细胞。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df76f3e6937337b3b73537db\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"肿瘤异质性背景\",\n          \"finding\": \"HBV/HCV相关HCC与Enterobacteriaceae升高及炎症反应增强相关；NASH相关HCC与Bacteroides/Ruminococcus富集及免疫抑制性胆汁酸代谢相关。CTNNB1突变导致免疫排斥表型，可能富集Fusobacterium nucleatum；TP53缺失导致屏障功能障碍和LPS易位。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::083cc10c162534396b0dcf19\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::339bb9290d98f30377030301\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管ICIs在晚期HCC中显示出一定疗效，但总体响应率有限且存在原发性耐药。目前缺乏可靠的预测生物标志物，且需要阐明肠道微生物组作为预测因子和治疗调节剂的具体作用机制，以优化患者分层和治疗方案。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7b089703cb17dc3c4ee5b187\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"肝细胞癌（HCC）患者；免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，包括PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂及与靶向药物TKI的联合治疗）；肠道微生物组及其代谢产物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c0cd375f708cdac5da432b15\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇关于肠道微生物组如何影响肝细胞癌（HCC）对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效的系统综述。文章首先梳理了不同治疗方案（单药、TKI单药、ICI联合TKI）下，响应者与无响应者之间特定的肠道微生物特征差异，指出如Akkermansia muciniphila、Ruminococcaceae等菌属与良好预后相关，而Bacteroides等则常与耐药相关。其次，文章评估了基于微生物组的干预策略，包括抗生素使用、益生菌补充、益生元摄入和粪便微生物群移植（FMT），并讨论了其临床潜力与挑战。机制部分详细阐述了微生物通过调节肿瘤微环境（TME）中的免疫细胞（如CD8+ T细胞、NK细胞、Tregs）以及产生关键代谢物（如短链脂肪酸SCFAs、次级胆汁酸、MAMPs）来增强抗肿瘤免疫反应的路径。最后，文章探讨了HCC病因异质性（病毒性 vs. 代谢性/NASH）、肿瘤遗传及代谢异质性与微生物组的相互作用，并指出了多组学整合、标准化临床试验及伦理物流挑战等未来方向。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1f3e98f86aa9737288087c35\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"HCC病因（HBV/HCV vs NASH）导致的微生物组差异及其对免疫治疗响应的不同影响。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8834b700014fe9559482d360\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"次级胆汁酸（UDCA, TUDCA）与ICI响应的关联，以及其通过NKT细胞介导的免疫激活机制。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e52fed9afee42929b618c972\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"FMT临床试验的进展、安全性顾虑、益生菌（Probio-M9）的初步疗效数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f8897d3045f6cf3e35e01d33\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"不同研究间存在显著的方法学差异和结果不一致性（如Shen et al.报告Akkermansia在无响应者中富集，与Zheng et al.相反），需谨慎引用，需注明情境依赖性。样本量普遍较小。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了HCC患者中ICI治疗响应者与无响应者的具体微生物分类学差异清单。例如，响应者富集Akkermansia muciniphila, Ruminococcaceae, Faecalibacterium; 无响应者富集Bacteroides, Proteobacteria, Prevotella。同时也提到了联合治疗（ICI+TKI）下的特定菌群变化。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::56828bb144170e1eacaa62e7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"许多机制细节来自小鼠模型或体外实验，在人类HCC中的直接验证有限。代谢物水平的因果关系尚需更多临床数据支持。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"详细阐述了微生物通过代谢物（SCFAs, 胆汁酸, MAMPs）和直接细胞互作（TLR, STING通路）调节抗肿瘤免疫的机制。具体包括：SCFAs维持屏障并抑制增殖；次级胆汁酸激活NKT细胞；A. muciniphila通过STING通路激活DC/NK细胞；L. rhamnosus通过cGAS/STING轴增强CD8+ T细胞交叉呈递。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6e0090d0ff672afb59ff4ca7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"大多数干预研究处于早期阶段（Phase I/II或回顾性分析），缺乏大规模随机对照试验证据。FMT的安全性和标准化问题突出。抗生素的影响复杂，取决于类型、时机和剂量。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了微生物靶向干预（FMT, 益生菌, 益生元, 抗生素）在HCC免疫治疗中的临床前和早期临床证据。例如Probio-M9提高ORR，FMT激活T细胞，抗生素通常降低疗效但存在例外。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e99c317b05be378537a0ec55\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这部分内容多为理论整合和假设，直接针对这些亚型的微生物干预临床试验数据不足。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"分析了HCC病因异质性（病毒性肝炎 vs NASH/MASLD）和肿瘤遗传/代谢特征如何塑造不同的微生物组景观，进而影响免疫治疗响应。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bbf11cba6cccb153c9fcf8c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述聚焦于HCC，虽然机制可能在其他实体瘤中保守，但直接将HCC的微生物标志物外推至其他癌症类型需谨慎，需考虑器官特异性和肿瘤微环境的差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::25f7613ff7964d5c53b4aa02\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中引用的微生物分类学结果在不同研究间存在矛盾，这反映了方法学异质性和生物学复杂性，而非简单的错误。在综合时不应强行统一，而应将其视为领域内的争议点或情境依赖现象。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8492d048b43cad61fbb16b3e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制描述中混合了人类临床观察和小鼠模型数据，需明确区分哪些是人类中已证实的关联，哪些是动物模型中的因果推断，避免高估人类体内的机制确定性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::09539de388e741601182cc61\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作者声称微生物组是“关键调节因子”，但这主要基于相关性研究和有限的干预试验，尚不能确立其在所有HCC患者中的决定性作用，需保留不确定性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::273f1dc44bae8c61ef331c0c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0113\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::7cecf289760510f7dd19eb85\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cea482f2e2f8c231afd6ce03\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4d51e5111995d479ac204855\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8ee5a9383b2afdaa5c1326e9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用前瞻性观察性队列设计。收集23名mCRPC患者在基线及治疗期间的直肠拭子（粪便）和口腔漱口水样本。使用Ion Torrent平台进行16S rRNA基因多重高变区测序，结合DADA2去噪和QIIME2分析流程进行物种分类。使用GLM整合多区域数据以评估差异丰度。通过qPCR独立验证关键菌种（S. salivarius, A. muciniphila）。纵向分析了9名患者的全程治疗样本以评估时间效应。将结果与既往文献及Shaikh等人的“综合指数”进行比较。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f316b32406a559e063321e21\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了首个针对mCRPC患者在接受ICI治疗前/初期微生物组特征的系统描述，揭示了该人群中特有的微生物-反应关联模式（如S. salivarius的正向关联和A. muciniphila的负向关联）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（n=23），统计效力有限；仅使用16S rRNA测序而非宏基因组，分辨率受限；未深入探讨具体的代谢机制或因果路径；结果可能受既往恩杂鲁胺治疗、饮食、地理因素等混杂因素影响；作者承认部分分类学鉴定存在不确定性（如Roseburia属）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6ec3f9ffb629d6a51133142e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"First Timepoint cohort (n=23), 16S sequencing & qPCR\",\n          \"finding\": \"整体α和β多样性在反应者与非反应者间无显著差异；个体间变异占主导（~50%）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9d2025bfc4afb44a959e7a39\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"First Timepoint cohort, GLM analysis of multiple hypervariable regions\",\n          \"finding\": \"Streptococcus salivarius在反应者粪便中显著富集（p=0.004），且qPCR证实该趋势；但该菌在口腔漱口水中的水平与反应无关，且口腔与粪便水平不相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fc83d59bc85334f3faa9c2cb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"First Timepoint cohort, 16S sequencing (V6-7 region) & qPCR\",\n          \"finding\": \"Akkermansia muciniphila在反应者中显著降低（与黑色素瘤等其他癌症报道相反），qPCR确认了这一减少趋势。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bda9398beeaca0e40b1be14c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Longitudinal analysis (n=9 patients across treatment cycles)\",\n          \"finding\": \"帕博利珠单抗治疗未引起全局微生物组成的显著变化；个体内样本聚类紧密，时间点对变异贡献极小（<3%）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e4f1b0368c2482cbe4cd9f10\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Application of Shaikh et al. integrated index\",\n          \"finding\": \"该综合指数未能区分本队列中的反应者与非反应者，表明不同癌症类型或治疗史可能导致微生物信号的特异性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5311a5785c595293f6da034c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7bf91791d72061e224f94980\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"既往研究表明肠道微生物影响ICI疗效，但在mCRPC背景下，特别是经过雄激素受体抑制剂（如恩杂鲁胺）预处理后的患者中，微生物组特征如何预测帕博利珠单抗的治疗反应？是否存在不同于其他实体瘤（如黑色素瘤）的微生物标志物？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0bb8230bd3b4569513ecd72d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"转移性去势抵抗性前列腺癌（mCRPC）患者，在恩杂鲁胺治疗进展后接受抗PD-1免疫检查点抑制剂（帕博利珠单抗）治疗。样本为粪便和口腔漱口水DNA。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4cb85d2bc4c086b0bb4325b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探究肠道微生物组组成与mCRPC患者对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗反应的关联。研究纳入了23名在恩杂鲁胺治疗下疾病进展并即将开始帕博利珠单抗治疗的mCRPC患者。通过16S rRNA基因测序（覆盖多个高变区）和定量PCR（qPCR），比较了治疗反应者（PSA下降>50%或影像学缓解）与非反应者的微生物特征。研究发现，尽管整体α和β多样性在主要队列中无显著差异，但特定菌属存在差异：反应者中粪肠球菌、拟杆菌等富集，而此前在其他癌症中被认为促进ICI疗效的黏蛋白降解菌Akkermansia muciniphila在反应者中反而减少。此外，发现口腔共生菌Streptococcus salivarius在粪便中的丰度与反应正相关，但在口腔样本中无此关联，提示其作用具有部位特异性。研究还验证了一个综合微生物指数在本队列中无效，并观察到治疗期间微生物组总体稳定。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0096a87790c289f61738c19d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅限mCRPC人群，且处于恩杂鲁胺治疗失败后阶段；不能直接外推至初治前列腺癌或其他早期癌症。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了mCRPC背景下特定的微生物标志物列表：S. salivarius（正向关联）、Bacteroides thetaiotaomicron（正向关联）、Enterococcaceae（正向关联）以及Akkermansia muciniphila（负向关联）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e9fc034cd2a3fa6bfb7f266d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"指数构建依赖于原始研究的分类学一致性，本研究中因分类差异进行了修正，结果反映的是修正后的指数表现。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"展示了基于多癌种数据的“综合指数”在本队列中失效的结果，强调了单一通用指数可能不适用于所有癌症类型。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bd48e3b304f5cb9a35091e55\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些机制多为基于文献的推测或体外/动物模型证据，本研究本身未直接测定肌苷水平或进行功能实验，属于作者的解释性讨论而非直接实验证据。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"探讨了A. muciniphila产生肌苷（inosine）的可能机制，并提出在前列腺癌中肌苷可能促进转移的相反假说，解释了为何其在反应者中减少。同时提及S. salivarius可能通过调节PPAR gamma发挥免疫调节作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::759881fb89d4c045e5cae0d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅涵盖短期治疗周期（4个周期+监测期），长期效应未知。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"纵向数据显示ICI治疗期间微生物组高度稳定，排除了治疗药物本身导致微生物组剧烈波动从而间接影响疗效的主要可能性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f7eafbd9fdbcc65bbebf325c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中提到既往研究显示恩杂鲁胺等雄激素受体轴靶向治疗会增加A. muciniphila水平，这可能构成了本研究中患者基线微生物组的背景状态。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1dfd9e226110208667d5fcf3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"S. salivarius在粪便中与疗效相关，但在口腔样本中无关联，且两者水平不相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fa8a027532c43a008390aa87\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Shaikh等人的综合指数在本队列中无预测价值。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::873c23476f247afe6b8f4d1e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究结果严格限定于“恩杂鲁胺治疗进展后”的mCRPC患者，其微生物组状态深受既往内分泌治疗影响，不能直接推广至未经内分泌治疗的前列腺癌患者或初治实体瘤患者。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7bcbe549d1bc887488ac8986\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"A. muciniphila在反应者中的减少与多数其他ICI研究相反，这可能与前列腺癌的特定病理生理环境（如肌苷促转移风险）或既往用药有关，解读时需避免将其视为普适规律。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::017a7a20036f46812363f7ff\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"S. salivarius的发现虽显著，但其具体免疫调节机制在本研究中仅为推测，需结合其他功能学研究谨慎引用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1fba0eec09372c5ec1d815d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量较小（n=23），发现的差异丰度菌群可能存在假阳性风险，尤其是qPCR验证仅针对少数几个菌种。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5e8434371ef288ce06725a7b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0270\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::936d6b010edab5e9feddf7a0\",\n          \"snapshot::153a59be1d09157a4ef3f708\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d5c16f7d284873fef733b9c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d710f3252d11b13e9a7fd75b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a7bf8d6f411f5b59057a16c7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Retrospective observational study. Cohort: 26 advanced NSCLC patients treated with anti-PD-1 monotherapy, categorized into Responders (PR+SD, n=17) and Non-Responders (PD, n=11), excluding those with recent antibiotic use or other infections. Samples: Bronchoalveolar lavage fluid (BALF) for 16S rRNA sequencing (V3-V4 region) and untargeted LC-MS/MS metabolomics; paired serum and BALF for LEGENDplex immunoassays of inflammatory cytokines/chemokines; tumor tissues for multiplex immunofluorescence staining (CD4, CD8, CD68, CD206). Analysis: Alpha/Beta diversity metrics, LEfSe for differential taxa, O2PLS and CCA for microbe-metabolite integration, ROC curves for predictive modeling, and correlation analyses linking microbes/metabolites to cytokine levels and immune cell infiltration.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::079f881d9d10dd29ddb3d705\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides the first detailed multi-omics landscape (microbiome + metabolome + immune profile) of the lower respiratory tract in advanced NSCLC patients undergoing ICI therapy, identifying specific microbial signatures (Bacillus vs. Sphingomonas/Sediminibacterium) associated with clinical outcomes.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Small sample size (n=26) limits statistical power and generalizability. Retrospective design and single-center origin introduce selection bias. Lack of longitudinal sampling before treatment initiation restricts causal inference regarding microbial changes. Gut microbiome data was not collected, preventing assessment of the lung-gut axis interactions.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7cf9c101c1a6eb891615fecd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Comparing Responders (PR/SD) vs. Non-Responders (PD) in advanced NSCLC.\",\n          \"finding\": \"Microbial diversity (beta diversity) significantly differed between groups, with Responders showing distinct community structures. Bacillus was enriched in Responders, while Sphingomonas and Sediminibacterium were associated with Non-Responders.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::be7ecd8c28479b6540ac1f4e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Metabolomic profiling of BALF.\",\n          \"finding\": \"Responders exhibited metabolic profiles favoring lipid metabolism and essential amino acid degradation pathways linked to beneficial microbes. Non-Responders showed alterations in these pathways associated with pathogenic genera.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::55417e480f58881beb89b2ca\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Immune microenvironment analysis (Tissue & Fluids).\",\n          \"finding\": \"Responders had higher infiltration of CD8+ T cells and M1 macrophages (CD68+/CD206-) in tumors. BALF from Responders showed elevated pro-inflammatory cytokines (IL-1β, MCP-1, IL-8) compared to Non-Responders, correlating with microbial markers.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3f39a90c39fa44373b7f2be7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Predictive modeling.\",\n          \"finding\": \"A multi-component model combining specific microbes, metabolites, and cytokines (e.g., IL-1β, TNF-α, IFN-α2) demonstrated potential for predicting ICI response, though validation is limited by sample size.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a5e874f49d2f21d3400b8dbd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e296d172c6594e49b9b83b45\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"While the gut microbiome's role in ICI response is well-documented, the specific microecological features and predictive value of the lower respiratory tract microbiome in advanced NSCLC remain unclear. This study seeks to determine if local microbial dysbiosis correlates with ICB efficacy and to uncover the underlying metabolic and immune mechanisms.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::691eb8c67286e9f783d4b5e0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Advanced non-small-cell lung cancer (NSCLC) patients receiving immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) monotherapy; focus on lower respiratory tract microbiome and metabolome via bronchoalveolar lavage fluid (BALF).\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a05d58ccaad85413a75334be\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This study investigates the role of the lower respiratory tract microbiome in predicting clinical responses to immune checkpoint blockade (ICB) in advanced NSCLC. Using a retrospective single-center cohort of 26 patients, the authors performed 16S rRNA sequencing and untargeted metabolomics on BALF samples, alongside cytokine/chemokine assays and multiplex immunohistochemistry on tissue biopsies. The research aims to identify microbial and metabolic signatures associated with treatment outcomes (Partial Response/Stable Disease vs. Progressive Disease) and elucidate the mechanisms by which local microbes influence the tumor immune microenvironment.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::77aa59c776d172f8abdea3a2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"The study explicitly contrasts its findings with the well-known gut microbiome-ICI relationship, highlighting the unique 'private identification card' nature of the lower respiratory tract microbiome.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::de69ae61fc4f79dde9b8bfce\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Demonstrates the feasibility of using BALF for multi-omics (16S, metabolomics) and immune profiling in NSCLC patients.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::03e48468f16d50d713772897\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"Limited to advanced NSCLC; small cohort (n=26); retrospective association only.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Identifies specific lower respiratory tract microbial taxa associated with ICI response in NSCLC: Bacillus enrichment correlates with positive response, while Sphingomonas and Sediminibacterium correlate with progression. Demonstrates that beta-diversity of the lung microbiome is a significant discriminator of clinical outcome.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::408595ee43f05e0c7296564a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"Mechanistic links are correlative (multi-omics integration); causality not proven. Does not isolate specific metabolites or test functional effects directly.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Proposes a mechanism where microbiome-derived metabolites (lipid and amino acid metabolism pathways) reshape the local immune microenvironment. Specifically, beneficial microbes promote the release of cytokines (IL-1β, MCP-1, IL-8) that recruit CD8+ T cells and M1 macrophages, enhancing anti-tumor immunity.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ad7bff57315d0d6ecf80a1a6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Do not generalize findings to all solid tumors; this is specific to advanced NSCLC.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::99a3074c1ab8975bfeb62b8c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The study does not establish causality; associations are observed in a retrospective cohort.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ebea914b9cf0d11acf683838\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Gut microbiome data is absent; do not infer lung-gut axis interactions from this paper alone.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::11de832a06116212f96c6194\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Sample size is small (n=26); results should be treated as hypothesis-generating rather than definitive predictive models.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::89bc0245d83cd6a54560d33b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0352\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-95bd9a77b14edf06222c\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-5c752c0f8036d5742e42\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a7194a689f46f19f0fc9\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-5f82ba52a99d38e52a55\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-5bcddf895da96806b16c\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-e07b4c340a667bb2f261\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::80663154eab12c4d18bfb7c0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e31d67fec0093217ac37e24b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1b8a3bb500ae32eea0b6adde\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::61269ab287cd16ea7e0ad41c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用系统综述方法，遵循PRISMA指南。检索策略包括四个主要数据库（PubMed, Scopus, Web of Science, EMBASE），时间范围为2010年1月至2025年4月。纳入标准限定为研究非肠道微生物群（即肿瘤组织内的微生物）并评估特定免疫终点（T细胞浸润、细胞因子、PD-L1、ICI反应性）。排除标准隐含在“非肠道”和“免疫终点”的限定中。由于研究间终点异质性大，作者决定不进行定量荟萃分析，而是进行定性综合。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a5da1b6ec9118c3d38c6879b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了关于肿瘤内微生物群（非肠道）在多种实体瘤中调节免疫反应和ICI疗效的系统性定性综述；归纳了三种主要的免疫调节机制；强调了效应的空间结构和肿瘤背景依赖性。\",\n          \"limits\": \"仅纳入17项研究，样本量有限；由于终点异质性未进行荟萃分析，缺乏量化效应大小；所给摘要未交代具体纳入研究的详细质量评估结果、偏倚风险评估细节以及各癌症亚组的具体效应方向差异；结论部分提出的临床转化建议属于未来展望，非本综述已验证的结果。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dd0bbe730e21fe2f7aa73c83\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"涉及黑色素瘤、胰腺癌、食管癌、胃癌、乳腺癌、肺癌和结直肠癌等多种实体瘤\",\n          \"finding\": \"肿瘤内细菌能够调节免疫反应和免疫检查点抑制剂的疗效\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::aaf47d69d976269623c51569\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"跨多种癌症类型的综合分析\",\n          \"finding\": \"识别出三个反复出现的机制：1) 通过抗原呈递和Th1极化激活免疫；2) 通过调节性T细胞募集和基质重塑抑制免疫；3) 通过微生物信号传导调节检查点和导致T细胞耗竭\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::59ce19c0f2a5468ebd4a843c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"所有纳入研究的综合观察\",\n          \"finding\": \"这些免疫调节效应具有空间结构特征，并且高度依赖于具体的肿瘤背景（tumor-context dependent）\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8328c390f2865cf509ee4c5f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bbc1b2d0b728e24fce2d9b6f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管肠道微生物群已知能调节全身免疫和ICI反应，但肿瘤驻留微生物群的作用仍未得到充分探索。本研究旨在回答：肿瘤内微生物群如何影响肿瘤内免疫反应和免疫治疗结果？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cf6ff7014f4ff58ef5648059\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"肿瘤内微生物群（tumor-resident microbiota）及其对实体瘤免疫反应和免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效的影响。涵盖黑色素瘤、胰腺癌、食管癌、胃癌、乳腺癌、肺癌和结直肠癌等实体瘤类型。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a68d1eccdacc9e676227db64\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该论文是一篇遵循PRISMA指南的系统综述，旨在评估肿瘤相关细菌对抗肿瘤免疫反应的影响。研究检索了2010年1月至2025年4月期间PubMed、Scopus、Web of Science和EMBASE数据库中的文献，纳入标准为表征非肠道微生物群并评估免疫终点（如T细胞浸润、细胞因子谱、PD-L1表达或ICI反应性）的研究。由于终点异质性，未进行荟萃分析。最终纳入17项研究，发现肿瘤内细菌通过三种主要机制调节免疫反应和ICI疗效：通过抗原呈递和Th1极化激活免疫；通过调节性T细胞募集和基质重塑抑制免疫；以及通过微生物信号传导调节检查点和导致T细胞耗竭。这些效应具有空间结构特征且依赖于肿瘤背景。结论认为肿瘤局部微生物群是肿瘤免疫微环境中的一个独特且可操作的组成部分，将其纳入免疫肿瘤学策略可能有助于生物标志物发现、患者分层和基于微生物组的疗法开发。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::52ea3a9e04f7600fdcaa2dc3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"区分‘肠道微生物群’与‘肿瘤驻留微生物群’的概念，强调后者是肿瘤免疫微环境的独特组成部分。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::241b91b165d6b70225a7bc3a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"三种免疫调节机制（激活、抑制、耗竭）的描述。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bbc9ac7d07f56fd5f3e1faac\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"呼吁绘制空间微生物异质性图谱、验证功能机制及临床转化。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c40c03f49dbc9d4188098c23\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这些机制是基于17项研究的定性综合，未提供量化证据强度；效应具有肿瘤类型特异性，不能简单外推至所有实体瘤；未区分这些机制与肠道菌群衍生的代谢物或免疫细胞之间的直接因果关系，仅描述关联。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肿瘤内微生物群调节抗肿瘤免疫的具体机制分类：1. 免疫激活（抗原呈递、Th1极化）；2. 免疫抑制（Treg募集、基质重塑）；3. 检查点调控与T细胞耗竭。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fc3fdaf5b1978c3cf6587567\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"未提供肿瘤内微生物群与肠道微生物群之间相互作用的具体数据；未明确比较肿瘤内微生物群与肠道微生物群对ICI疗效影响的相对重要性；所给摘要未交代具体哪些细菌物种与疗效改善或恶化相关。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"确认了肿瘤内微生物群对ICI疗效的影响，指出其效应依赖于肿瘤背景。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7fdde3f87c2b3b4bf4ef22b5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述关注的是‘肿瘤内’微生物，而非用户核心问题中的‘肠道’微生物。两者虽有联系，但不能直接等同。使用时需明确区分作用部位（局部肿瘤 vs 全身/肠道）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c4507e6d04424622c51d60c1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"由于未进行荟萃分析，提供的机制是定性归纳，缺乏效应大小的量化支持。在解释机制强度时需保持谨慎。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ee1d9dfb4ee2c393bd63e767\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"效应被描述为‘肿瘤背景依赖’，意味着不同癌症类型中微生物的作用可能截然不同，不可泛化为普适规律。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fa5328dc5fc87d2b2d71a51e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"所给摘要未提供纳入研究的具体质量评分或偏倚风险结果，因此对其结论的稳健性评估受限。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::07cfa83caee64fdf2fd0ca21\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0457\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_empty\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::b68dbdfd2cdbe0ee207c9cbe\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"source_identities\": {\n      \"P0080\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0080\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0080\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Gut microbiota-derived hexa-acylated lipopolysaccharides enhance cancer immunotherapy responses\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.1038/s41564-025-01930-y\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"1c98ea21fbac0226e1f0c817968ad885448151f3\"\n      },\n      \"P0309\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0309\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0309\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Immunomodulation by the Commensal Microbiome During Immune-Targeted Interventions: Focus on Cancer Immune Checkpoint Inhibitor Therapy and Vaccination\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.3389/fimmu.2021.643255\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"8552db34c533ee32ec30305e104babc5da9914ae\"\n      },\n      \"P0028\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0028\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0028\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Bidirectional regulation of the gut microbiome-immune axis in the immune microenvironment of colorectal cancer and targeted interventions\",\n        \"doi\": \"10.4251/wjgo.v17.i10.109503\",\n        \"paper_id\": \"0d36b62772e0930cc8aead7edc85535b5b389e25\"\n      },\n      \"P0114\": {\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0114\",\n        \"source_id\": \"source::P0114\",\n        \"aliases\": [],\n        \"title\": \"Abstract 6686: The mechanism of gut microbiome-mediated immune activation on the clinical efficacy of PD-1